OL,3,GNEWSADramatic footage shows fishing
OL,4,Aboat smashing apart on rocks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fishing boat has been smashed apart
OL,7,Fby the sea 11 days after it ran aground
OL,8,Foff the west coast of Orkney.
OL,10,FDramatic footage shows a hole in its
OL,11,Fhull, while the stern appears to have
OL,12,Falmost separated from the rest of the
OL,13,Fvessel.
OL,15,FGenesis was abandoned after it struck
OL,16,Frocks close to the Old Man Of Hoy on 1
OL,17,FOctober.
OL,19,FAfter issuing a mayday call, all 17
OL,20,Fcrew members were winched to safety by
OL,21,Fa Coastguard helicopter and taken to
OL,22,Fshore.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
